        ex:hasText "By adopting Regular monitoring of costs against the budget and taking corrective actions promptly when necessary, Our company's aim to optimize costs, ensure compatibility with the authority's budgetary capacity, and guarantee the expected quality of service, all while targeting Our company's projected margin within the 25% to 35% range. Based on Our company's company context, the projected margin on any contract is targeted between 25% and 35%, as indicated by Standardized Pricing Model target gross margin percentage range." ;
