    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding cost-optimization strategies to meet the budget constraints of 900,000 over 5 years, Our company's commercial posture favours configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability. Our company's also arbitrate toward more cost-efficient tiers/models where the requirements allow, which can help in optimizing costs." ;
